WEBVTT

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:11.250
What?

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:12.990
Tsukishima...

00:00:21.330 --> 00:00:23.910
<b>Tsukishima Jinbei Is Here!!</b>

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:29.130
Miss...

00:00:31.270 --> 00:00:32.600
Wonderful.

00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:35.290
Even if her appearance is not
 that of the Kuroageha butterfly,

00:00:35.290 --> 00:00:39.100
she seems to have gained the 
power that fills the Well.

00:00:39.670 --> 00:00:42.770
Miss... Why?

00:00:42.770 --> 00:00:44.520
The princess and I

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:47.650
both survived, thanks to the 
power of the Eternal Insect.

00:00:48.270 --> 00:00:52.690
There's nothing strange about her 
slaying a little rat that opposes me.

00:00:52.690 --> 00:00:55.900
Her memories are gone.

00:00:56.910 --> 00:00:58.740
<b>Jin</b>

00:00:58.050 --> 00:00:59.000
What?

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:00.370
Miss...

00:01:00.370 --> 00:01:01.860
Your hand...

00:01:01.860 --> 00:01:04.740
Look at your palm...

00:01:06.140 --> 00:01:09.140
You carved that there yourself.

00:01:06.670 --> 00:01:11.420
<b>Jin</b>

00:01:09.140 --> 00:01:11.420
Please remember, miss!

00:01:16.520 --> 00:01:17.430
I don't know it.

00:01:17.910 --> 00:01:18.820
Huh?

00:01:18.820 --> 00:01:20.140
Miss...

00:01:20.670 --> 00:01:22.430
That's impossible...

00:01:26.600 --> 00:01:27.690
Jinbei-kun!

00:01:27.690 --> 00:01:28.480
Tsukishima!

00:01:28.740 --> 00:01:32.420
I apologize for making you 
listen to such nonsense.

00:01:32.420 --> 00:01:35.300
Now, our lord waits in Oosaka.

00:01:35.300 --> 00:01:37.490
Don't think you can leave 
without dealing with us!

00:01:37.950 --> 00:01:40.300
We won't just let you go.

00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:42.490
I'll stop you... Using my full power!

00:01:43.190 --> 00:01:45.750
There is no need to sully the princess's hands.

00:01:49.320 --> 00:01:51.350
Now behold.

00:01:51.350 --> 00:01:57.720
Because you have delayed me here, 
I will reduce everything in Kishuu to ash!

00:02:08.220 --> 00:02:09.270
What?

00:02:28.700 --> 00:02:32.840
I can crush the likes of you in an instant.

00:02:34.860 --> 00:02:35.670
Wait...

00:02:36.360 --> 00:02:38.670
Jinbei-kun, don't be stupid!

00:02:39.380 --> 00:02:41.330
I'm going to be stupid!

00:02:41.330 --> 00:02:43.200
No...

00:02:49.110 --> 00:02:52.500
Not even a moth would leap 
into a flame such as this.

00:03:00.010 --> 00:03:01.450
Keep winning until you die!

00:03:02.080 --> 00:03:03.570
Now is the time!

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:05.490
Even if...

00:03:06.040 --> 00:03:07.760
I die!

00:03:08.610 --> 00:03:10.280
I will...

00:03:13.230 --> 00:03:15.280
win against Sanada!

00:03:28.300 --> 00:03:31.520
The first has fallen quite quickly...

00:03:40.500 --> 00:03:43.810
I thought he'd be more fun to kill.

00:03:45.060 --> 00:03:47.060
You will follow him!

00:03:47.730 --> 00:03:49.040
You bastard...

00:03:49.480 --> 00:03:52.920
I won't die unless I kill you first!

00:03:54.600 --> 00:03:59.340
<i>Repentance Slash Climax!</i>

00:04:00.110 --> 00:04:01.410
Plus...

00:04:01.410 --> 00:04:03.930
<i>Flowering Wind-style Draw: Flying Swallow!</i>

00:04:07.660 --> 00:04:08.430
What?

00:04:08.760 --> 00:04:10.550
It's like there's some kind of wall.

00:04:11.080 --> 00:04:12.000
Matsukichi!

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:12.960
Tamekichi!

00:04:12.960 --> 00:04:14.750
<i>Full-Power Slap!</i>

00:04:15.560 --> 00:04:16.940
I won't die before I win...

00:04:16.940 --> 00:04:19.320
<i>Full-Throttle Fire!</i>

00:04:22.330 --> 00:04:23.740
Me, too!

00:04:24.060 --> 00:04:25.800
I'll win until I die...

00:04:25.800 --> 00:04:27.490
No matter what it takes!

00:04:28.280 --> 00:04:30.940
<i>Princess Camellia: Chinpou Spray!</i>

00:04:38.780 --> 00:04:41.340
I told you... It's useless.

00:04:43.250 --> 00:04:45.160
What do we do?

00:04:53.260 --> 00:04:54.510
Mugai-kun!

00:04:56.260 --> 00:04:58.660
<i>Jingaitou: Shattered Ice!</i>

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:10.160
<i>Jingaitou: Phantasm Light!</i>

00:05:14.060 --> 00:05:16.580
This is Saizou's power?

00:05:17.060 --> 00:05:19.310
But it won't work on me!

00:05:21.880 --> 00:05:23.160
Mugai-san!

00:05:23.160 --> 00:05:25.180
His powers have been revealed.

00:05:25.180 --> 00:05:26.260
Indeed.

00:05:26.260 --> 00:05:27.590
What do you mean?

00:05:27.930 --> 00:05:31.410
His shock waves are simply invisible.

00:05:31.910 --> 00:05:34.780
While he's blocking our attacks, 
you can just barely see them.

00:05:35.250 --> 00:05:36.750
Black powder...

00:05:36.750 --> 00:05:38.710
That's what his shock waves are?

00:05:38.710 --> 00:05:39.750
Indeed.

00:05:39.750 --> 00:05:41.530
These are iron scales.

00:05:41.530 --> 00:05:44.110
But what good will knowing that do you?

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:52.990
The shock waves turned into insects!

00:05:56.660 --> 00:05:58.330
<i>Secret Technique: Thousand Bladed Flowers!</i>

00:06:03.260 --> 00:06:05.050
I've no time for these little maggots!

00:06:10.390 --> 00:06:13.010
You are my next prey!

00:06:20.360 --> 00:06:21.650
I can't move...

00:06:36.360 --> 00:06:37.410
Potato-boy...

00:06:43.280 --> 00:06:46.580
The Eternal Insect's power which filled the Well

00:06:46.580 --> 00:06:48.170
has revived and awakened him?

00:06:48.760 --> 00:06:51.400
It's just like on Hachijo Island.

00:06:51.400 --> 00:06:55.200
I was right... Jinbei-kun bears 
the blood of Insect Hunters.

00:06:55.200 --> 00:06:58.060
Insect Hunters? Like Mugai-san?

00:06:58.580 --> 00:07:01.310
Yes, probably from his mother's side.

00:07:01.310 --> 00:07:04.000
But why would it turn him into that?

00:07:04.720 --> 00:07:09.170
The Eternal Insect cursed the clan of Insect 
Hunters and bathed in their blood.

00:07:09.890 --> 00:07:13.120
That's why they respond to 
the Eternal Insect's power.

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:16.590
The wounded Jinbei-kun woke 
after he came into contact

00:07:16.590 --> 00:07:19.120
with the Insect Magistrate's hair,

00:07:19.120 --> 00:07:22.080
which is imbued with the same power.

00:07:33.970 --> 00:07:39.140
<i>Then the power of the Eternal Insect 
flows through his blood, as well?</i>

00:07:46.270 --> 00:07:49.150
I hate everything... Everything!

00:07:49.150 --> 00:07:50.900
Everything is my enemy.

00:07:52.230 --> 00:07:53.680
<i>That voice...</i>

00:07:53.680 --> 00:07:55.760
Everything is my enemy.

00:07:55.760 --> 00:07:57.010
Defeat them.

00:07:57.560 --> 00:07:59.950
Defeat all the enemies.

00:08:00.530 --> 00:08:04.360
<i>These are the thoughts of the insect  
connected to the servant!</i>

00:08:04.810 --> 00:08:06.840
Everything is my enemy.

00:08:06.840 --> 00:08:08.080
Defeat them.

00:08:08.080 --> 00:08:11.920
<i>On Hachijo Island, the thoughts 
overwhelmed me...</i>

00:08:13.430 --> 00:08:14.930
<i>I can't let that happen again!</i>

00:08:15.500 --> 00:08:16.860
<i>I can't...</i>

00:08:18.750 --> 00:08:20.350
What are you doing,

00:08:21.310 --> 00:08:23.230
potato-boy?!

00:08:30.510 --> 00:08:33.280
Aren't you going to be a samurai 
who wins until he dies?

00:08:59.230 --> 00:09:02.810
Mugai-dono, thank you!

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:06.600
Even if it kills me, Sanada Yukimura,

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:09.110
I shall defeat you!

00:09:11.700 --> 00:09:12.610
Nonsense.

00:09:20.060 --> 00:09:22.380
I shall go back with the princess.

00:09:22.850 --> 00:09:25.580
On my pride as a samurai, I swear 
that I shall go to Oosaka,

00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:27.330
where the Eternal Insect waits.

00:09:27.590 --> 00:09:30.190
You are no samurai!

00:09:30.190 --> 00:09:32.890
A samurai helps others...

00:09:32.890 --> 00:09:36.090
I will save the servant!

00:09:37.900 --> 00:09:39.600
What is that?

00:09:39.950 --> 00:09:41.870
I don't know...

00:09:41.870 --> 00:09:43.600
But run away!

00:09:44.090 --> 00:09:47.350
Your battle bores me.

00:09:47.900 --> 00:09:49.860
I will defeat him.

00:09:50.300 --> 00:09:53.290
Please leave the servant to me.

00:09:53.290 --> 00:09:54.390
But...

00:09:54.390 --> 00:09:59.020
I promised that I would protect her, 
no matter what happened!

00:10:12.120 --> 00:10:16.120
You are unworthy of fighting me.

00:10:16.120 --> 00:10:17.550
Our opponent is...

00:10:18.450 --> 00:10:20.050
Sanada Yukimura!

00:10:20.560 --> 00:10:22.180
You fight me!

00:10:26.730 --> 00:10:28.850
<i>Hydrangea Bomb: Ten Lotuses!</i>

00:10:31.680 --> 00:10:34.710
<i>Full-Power Great Yokodzuna Slap!</i>

00:11:09.930 --> 00:11:15.150
<i>The closer he comes, 
the more the poison takes him.</i>

00:11:15.150 --> 00:11:17.230
<i>So why does he not even try</i>

00:11:17.230 --> 00:11:19.360
<i>to draw his sword?</i>

00:11:20.450 --> 00:11:22.400
Are you an idiot?

00:11:22.400 --> 00:11:26.620
You must not lose your memories!

00:11:27.050 --> 00:11:30.370
If it's the poison that's making you forget...

00:11:32.110 --> 00:11:35.630
I'll absorb it all into my body!

00:11:56.080 --> 00:12:00.300
I promised I would protect you...

00:12:00.300 --> 00:12:03.160
I want to protect your memories, too!

00:12:05.760 --> 00:12:10.750
All my memories with you are 
flashing through my mind.

00:12:11.250 --> 00:12:13.870
I remember them all so clearly!

00:12:14.460 --> 00:12:17.710
Stop it... You cannot absorb the poison!

00:12:18.100 --> 00:12:20.680
Do you remember, Miss?

00:12:21.250 --> 00:12:22.130
Stop it!

00:12:22.130 --> 00:12:27.350
Then I'll take more of your poison...

00:13:01.920 --> 00:13:04.680
<b>Jin</b>

00:13:12.430 --> 00:13:14.940
<b>Jin</b>

00:13:23.810 --> 00:13:25.700
A heart that cares for others...

00:13:26.680 --> 00:13:31.200
It was your heart that made me remember...

00:13:32.930 --> 00:13:34.250
Jinbei...

00:13:44.060 --> 00:13:46.010
Her memories have returned?

00:13:46.400 --> 00:13:51.430
But even if they have, she is destined 
to return to Oosaka.

00:13:51.430 --> 00:13:53.110
We won't allow that!

00:13:53.110 --> 00:13:55.450
After all that Tsukishima has done,

00:13:55.450 --> 00:13:58.150
we will protect the Magistrate!

00:13:58.700 --> 00:14:02.900
You can protect no one...

00:14:03.070 --> 00:14:07.070
Not even the thousands in Kishuu!

00:14:16.290 --> 00:14:17.160
What?

00:14:18.990 --> 00:14:20.920
I remember now...

00:14:21.420 --> 00:14:24.170
My duty to protect the lives of the people!

00:14:24.790 --> 00:14:26.340
How stupid.

00:14:26.870 --> 00:14:31.440
Even your power changes nothing.

00:14:33.070 --> 00:14:36.430
Observe, as Kishuu is destroyed!

00:14:51.090 --> 00:14:52.370
I won't let you!

00:14:53.940 --> 00:14:55.740
<i>Compassion Slash!</i>

00:14:59.090 --> 00:15:00.080
<i>Hydrangea Blossoms!</i>

00:15:04.420 --> 00:15:06.370
<i>Full-Power Slap!</i>

00:15:08.120 --> 00:15:10.470
<i>Jingaitou: Cascade!</i>

00:15:12.270 --> 00:15:14.850
<i>Flowering Wind-style Draw: 
Divine Punishment!</i>

00:15:18.800 --> 00:15:20.920
Time to wake up, kiddo!

00:15:22.700 --> 00:15:24.770
You can do it, can't you, Tsukishima?

00:15:24.770 --> 00:15:26.030
Jinbei-kun!

00:15:26.420 --> 00:15:29.130
It's morning, Tsukishima!

00:15:32.220 --> 00:15:35.780
So if I kill him, they'll lose their will to fight?

00:15:42.940 --> 00:15:45.740
Good morning!

00:15:55.870 --> 00:15:58.430
I cannot sleep right now!

00:16:02.300 --> 00:16:06.440
I'll go back to sleep after I defeat you, 
Sanada Yukimura!

00:16:07.540 --> 00:16:08.940
Nonsense.

00:16:08.940 --> 00:16:12.020
Look around you... Kishuu is finished.

00:16:12.020 --> 00:16:15.450
And I will take the princess back to Oosaka.

00:16:15.820 --> 00:16:19.120
You can't decide how others will live!

00:16:19.120 --> 00:16:23.460
Not the people of Kishuu... 
And not the servant!

00:16:24.450 --> 00:16:26.710
The town won't last much longer.

00:16:27.250 --> 00:16:30.800
The people of Kishuu have already given up.

00:16:31.450 --> 00:16:33.390
That isn't true...

00:16:33.390 --> 00:16:35.040
I can feel it.

00:16:35.040 --> 00:16:39.720
Even now, they haven't lost hope!

00:16:40.150 --> 00:16:43.120
Let's go, Sanada Yukimura!

00:16:45.100 --> 00:16:49.070
Given that poisoned body of yours, 
I can't believe you can fight so well.

00:16:49.920 --> 00:16:55.530
But the moment you tire, 
you and Kishuu will be turned to ash!

00:16:55.920 --> 00:16:57.950
I will not give up...

00:16:57.950 --> 00:17:02.540
Or the people behind me that I'm 
protecting will be lost to terror!

00:17:02.830 --> 00:17:04.130
Idiot.

00:17:04.130 --> 00:17:06.900
You know neither fear nor your proper place.

00:17:06.900 --> 00:17:09.800
You're merely an idiot, rushing to your death!

00:17:10.050 --> 00:17:11.380
Even if I am an idiot,

00:17:11.380 --> 00:17:14.050
I must be a shining star.

00:17:17.810 --> 00:17:21.140
One that erases their fear!

00:17:21.740 --> 00:17:23.520
Even if it's impossible, keep thinking it.

00:17:23.520 --> 00:17:24.820
Keep saying it!

00:17:24.820 --> 00:17:26.400
Keep doing it...

00:17:26.400 --> 00:17:29.230
This is the time!

00:17:33.320 --> 00:17:36.990
Leave the rest of them to us!

00:17:40.220 --> 00:17:42.490
Get him, Tsukishima!

00:17:48.570 --> 00:17:50.250
You can do it, Tsukishima!

00:17:50.250 --> 00:17:52.760
<i>Full-Power Combo Slap!</i>

00:17:59.480 --> 00:18:00.260
Jinbei!

00:18:07.990 --> 00:18:11.820
Now it's time to end the 
Kishuu people's suffering...

00:18:12.170 --> 00:18:16.200
And to avenge Oooka-dono!

00:18:16.370 --> 00:18:17.950
Silence, rat.

00:18:18.720 --> 00:18:19.910
Begone!

00:18:28.320 --> 00:18:33.000
Can you not die, human?

00:18:33.550 --> 00:18:36.550
I will keep winning until I die!

00:18:38.300 --> 00:18:43.810
<i>Tsukishima-style: Mt. Fuji Storm!</i>

00:18:46.560 --> 00:18:50.980
<i>Tsukishima-style: Mt. Fuji Rising Dragon!</i>

00:18:57.370 --> 00:19:03.850
<i>Tsukishima-style: Mt. Fuji Meteor Drop!</i>

00:19:59.020 --> 00:20:03.840
Citizens of Kishuu, I have 
defeated Sanada Yukimura!

00:20:06.020 --> 00:20:10.430
Thank you! Thank you!

00:20:10.850 --> 00:20:14.000
Thank you!

00:20:31.070 --> 00:20:33.890
Miss, we're nearly to Edo.

00:20:35.250 --> 00:20:37.540
This may be the first time...

00:20:37.540 --> 00:20:41.070
I've always let fate rule my life.

00:20:41.070 --> 00:20:44.220
But now, I wish to return to Edo, too.

00:20:46.920 --> 00:20:49.220
I'm looking forward to my days in Edo.

00:20:54.590 --> 00:20:57.440
Jinbei, I'm actually...

00:20:57.440 --> 00:20:59.420
I look forward to it, as well!

00:21:00.920 --> 00:21:04.370
Someday, I'll get to show the Insect Magistrate

00:21:04.370 --> 00:21:07.340
Edo's blue skies, alongside everyone else!

00:21:19.870 --> 00:21:21.790
I'm looking at them now.

00:22:23.170 --> 00:22:25.420
Welcome back, Jinbei-sama!

00:22:25.420 --> 00:22:28.250
I'm back, Oharu-dono!

00:22:30.890 --> 00:22:34.450
We haven't been in Edo for five minutes.

00:22:34.450 --> 00:22:35.740
Lucky pervert.

00:22:36.700 --> 00:22:38.350
By now, it's a daily occurrence.

00:22:38.750 --> 00:22:40.900
Jinbei-kun, an insect has appeared!

00:22:40.900 --> 00:22:42.250
Get to work...

00:22:42.870 --> 00:22:43.830
What?

00:22:44.130 --> 00:22:45.120
Here I go!

00:22:45.120 --> 00:22:46.050
Bye!

00:22:46.050 --> 00:22:50.010
Time for the Insect Magistrate's 
to return to work!

00:22:50.350 --> 00:22:51.100
Yeah!

00:22:55.250 --> 00:22:59.000
<b>The End</b>
